<div class="faq-section">
  <h2>Frequently Asked Questions about Australia</h2>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the capital and currency of Australia?</h3><p>The capital of Australia is Canberra and the currency is the Australian dollar (AUD), symbol $.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the capital of Australia?</h3><p>The capital of Australia is Canberra.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What currency does Australia use?</h3><p>Australia uses the Australian dollar (AUD, symbol: $).</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What language do they speak in Australia?</h3><p>The official language of Australia is English.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is the dialling code for Australia?</h3><p>The international dialling code for Australia is +61.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>What side of the road does Australia drive on?</h3><p>Australia drives on the left-hand side of the road.</p></div>
</div>



